{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49551","headline":"何满子 一 · 毛熙震","name":"何满子 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寞芳菲暗度，岁华如箭堪惊。\n缅想旧欢多少事，转添春思难平。\n曲槛丝垂金柳，小窗弦断银筝。\n深院空闻燕语，满园闲落花轻。\n一片相思休不得，忍教长日愁生。\n谁见夕阳孤梦，觉来无限伤情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛熙震","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49551.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49551","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}